    </div>
    <div id="waves" class="flex gap-1 justify-center h-[40px] items-center mb-3"></div>

    <p class="text-xs mb-2">Reel 30s — Add video 30s max — Test 30s — If more cancel</p>
    <input id="reelVideo" type="file" accept="video/*" class="w-full bg-[#2a2010] p-2 rounded mb-3 text-xs">
    <p id="reelInfo" class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 mb-3">Select video — 30s max — If you select more than 30s — alert cancel — test all are options — 30s reel — Link same</p>

    <p class="text-xs mb-2">Voice effects:</p>
